<title>POLAND: NOVITA NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.41 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.81 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.04 vs   0.41</p>
<p> Sales		    6.85 vs   5.77</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.87 vs   3.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.02 vs   3.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.39 vs   4.48</p>
<p> Sales		   62.26 vs  50.57</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
